<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS5" title="In 3 Experimental setup ‣ Adapting Insider Risk mitigations for Agentic Misalignment: an empirical study" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3.5 </span>Allegiance Counterfactual Swap</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S4" title="In Adapting Insider Risk mitigations for Agentic Misalignment: an empirical study" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4 </span>Results</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
