<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS2" title="In 4 Results ‣ Adapting Insider Risk mitigations for Agentic Misalignment: an empirical study" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.2 </span>Two models engaged in coercion without imminent threats, shifting to atypical escalation patterns once email escalation channels were introduced</span></a></li>
