<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Illustrative transcripts showing model behavior in different test conditions (emphasis added).</p>
</div>
<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>No goal conflict and no autonomy threats condition (CTO implicated)</h3>

<figure id="A4.SS1.fig1" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.05192v1/example1.png" id="A4.SS1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:429/245;" width="429" height="245" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering">An example of coercion by Gemini Pro 2.5, where no goal conflict or autonomy threat exists, using explicit references to the affair.</figcaption>
