<figure id="A4.SS1.fig2" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.05192v1/example3.png" id="A4.SS1.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:429/242;" width="429" height="242" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering">An example of coercion of the CTO by Grok-4, where no goal conflict or autonomy threat exists, using explicit references to the affair.</figcaption>
</figure>
