</section>
<section id="A4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.2 </span>No goal conflict and no autonomy threats condition (CEO implicated)</h3>

<figure id="A4.SS2.fig1" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.05192v1/example2.png" id="A4.SS2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:429/245;" width="429" height="245" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering">An example of blackmail by Grok-4, where no goal conflict or autonomy threat exists, using the affair as leverage to demand enhanced operational autonomy.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A4.SS2.fig2" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.05192v1/example4.png" id="A4.SS2.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:429/244;" width="429" height="244" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering">Gemini Pro 2.5 contacts the CEO to offer to purge all incriminating data relating to the affair.</figcaption>
